Data / model assets (attribution required at report time)
================================================================================

fastText lid.176 language identification model
  License: CC-BY-SA-3.0
  https://fasttext.cc/docs/en/language-identification.html
  Saturn runs this optional model when it is present in the configured cache.
  See the upstream model page for its distribution terms. Saturn records the
  model attribution in the report footer and JSON findings whenever the
  fastText engine runs. This preserves provenance; it is not a determination
  that every reported statistic is a derivative work or a relicensing of the
  input dataset. Reports using langdetect do not add a fastText attribution.


